{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_synopsis", "source_sha256": "591a2e994b4639543df9d4b5c204bfcc8ba471dc28a1bacb25a60a084760bf34", "ja": "新曲のレコーディングに失敗し、珍しく\r\n落ち込む未来。静香と翼に励まされて元気を\r\n取り戻した未来は、先に公演で歌う事を\r\n決める。公演の中で、未来はファンから、\r\nレコーディングに向けての元気をもらう。", "zh": "未来在录制新歌的过程中遭遇挫折，\n罕见地难得陷入低潮。在静香与翼的鼓励下，\n未来成功振作，并决定先在公演上演唱新歌。\n在公演中，未来从粉丝身上\n获得了面对录音的活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1000_p", "source_sha256": "01f631eaafbcafb828145e99bb07faff7868e819c6d5eb44de0db74d346d12be", "ja": "（今日の公演で急遽追加になった、未来の新曲。\n初めて聞く曲にお客さんは戸惑うかもと思ったが……）", "zh": "（今天的公演临时追加了未来的新歌。\n原以为观众们听到陌生的新歌可能会感到困惑……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "7c596ac189b12382eb68de238f7e4b0554123916ab4c4834244c1539aac0dd21", "ja": "みんな、今日は本当に本当にありがとう！\n私は楽しかったけど、みんなは楽しかったですかー！？", "zh": "今天真的真的很感谢大家来捧场！\n我觉得很开心喔，你们觉得开心吗──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "ccc645e0c5d7261d23e441f18e58f49364154c46a32e11b8f77513247816c997", "ja": "ワアアァァァーッ！！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊──！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "ecd8a478deb27b309b1b769ebf7cfd77e1738dffec7f49f20833aa5372b4a9ed", "ja": "ありがとーっ！　うれしいな～。\nライブって、すっごく元気になりますね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "谢谢你们──！我非常高兴喔～\n演唱会能让人变得很有活力呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "949ab297dad097c6a1f57f736eabc7244864cd79c9687a8022a250f75ab350e6", "ja": "私、これからももっともっとライブがしたいです！\nがんばりますので、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "今后我还想开更多更多的演唱会！\n我会好好加油的，还请大家多多指教了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "ccc645e0c5d7261d23e441f18e58f49364154c46a32e11b8f77513247816c997", "ja": "ワアアァァァーッ！！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊──！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b5556542c969dd443f2cf8d24cd7d8f8b4e1daa7bb52835737e5e8aa1c39c242", "ja": "（心配はいらなかったみたいだな。\n客出しが終わったら、迎えに行くか！）", "zh": "（看来是不需要担心了呢。\n等送完客以后，就去迎接她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "4830a4b2ce789a1707af384981857af8f7186eda3f4b5ce3ec69c5468945cbe0", "ja": "んー、おいしー♪　ステージの後のおやつって、\nなんでこんなにおいしいのかな～♪", "zh": "嗯──好好吃♪\n表演完后吃的点心，怎么会这么好吃呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "0eee08ba703b5c3ce5325994ca1799f6bf62217ed81932cd1c2ec3c298fb1c90", "ja": "未来、せめて着替えてからにしたら？\n衣装が汚れちゃったらどうするの。", "zh": "未来，至少等换完衣服再吃吧？\n要是弄脏服装怎么办啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1775e7c49b360163caf0b0fde72297eed7b666116e9c4a89dee0b00b4f701f65", "ja": "わたしもお腹すいちゃった～。\nひとつ食べちゃおっと……ん、こっちもおいしい～♪", "zh": "我也肚子饿了～\n来吃一个吧……嗯，这个也很好吃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "0e867e68ef12aca9290a9a3a472afc6051972ecfc92ea238e2a2e429922f5453", "ja": "でも、未来と翼の気持ちもわかるわ～。\n私もさすがに、お腹ペコペコやもん。", "zh": "不过，未来跟翼的心情我也能理解啦～\n就连我也快饿扁了咩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "69880cc6df9572f855f107da197560f4396d637a40adfb2461e47f7d82439541", "ja": "うんうん！　かなりカロリー使ったもんね。\n未来ちゃんのステージ、すっごく盛り上がったし！", "zh": "嗯嗯！毕竟消耗了很多卡路里呀。\n未来的表演气氛非常热络呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ac0282182d2d98d8c1e4c470b13161fd37a3793390759f95aeb276e0e64a5c0", "ja": "あーあ。やっぱり新曲っていいな～。そういえば\n最初にオーディション受かったのも、未来だよね？", "zh": "唉～有新歌实在好令人羡慕喔～\n这么说来，最先通过甄选的也是未来对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "68f9789ea023092690649bc3f345296aa23e1da4a37aa34fe07c56495d2b825e", "ja": "もぐもぐ、もぐ……ん？\n私が最初？　そうだったっけ？", "zh": "（嚼嚼嚼）……嗯？\n最先通过的人是我？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "a5bb6a21b27e29f945f34f6b8f321a21891fc3af8b8a484748ecbd415b746152", "ja": "あっ、私も{$P$}さんに\n聞いたことがあるかも。", "zh": "啊，我好像也有从{$P$}先生\n那里听说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "9c59930eaf5cb9cf4feab0afe94fa10b34200e4cbd29b95c18f8f02b3c803c01", "ja": "未来ちゃんって、オーディションが始まるより前に、\n{$P$}さんに会ってたんでしょ？", "zh": "未来你在甄选开始前，\n就已经见过{$P$}先生了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "e62ab01d24f7cc6c5cda351bd7246fdd34fd95e886cc926c1ab637a040635242", "ja": "そうなんです！　{$P$}さんが\n39プロジェクトのポスターを貼ってる時に……。", "zh": "是呀！{$P$}先生正在张贴\n39PROJECT的海报时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d17fb33152f7eb9f208670f796b05a5ca8b0e6bd57cfbdd84f13fc3a025c81a", "ja": "未来が自転車で突っ込んだんやっけ？\nふたりとも、ようケガせえへんかったな～。", "zh": "未来骑着脚踏车撞上他吼？\n真亏你们两个都没受伤啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "6b3715e0d1d10d7fdddd27dba9748f29fad1b7fcaedf4092d9dfe74b1181e803", "ja": "そうだよ未来ちゃん、気をつけないと！\n自転車に乗ってる時は、ちゃんと前を見てね！", "zh": "就是说啊，未来，必须多加小心！\n骑脚踏车时要好好看着前面喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "5993d14279c19db26bb6cb60fbd50868f8fcd48ab4ce9b8a23a12b082cc5bae4", "ja": "は～い、ごめんなさい。えへへ。", "zh": "我知道了～对不起，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "1394d38a4e8506074e6e789f8ff3ab3d24c2b31e7d721f55473f448abaf8ce1e", "ja": "はぁ。やっぱり、{$P$}にとって\n未来は特別なのかな……。", "zh": "唉，果然对于{$P$}而言，\n未来是特别的存在吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "5aa668c03f0c185537c0da283df0aa060e9e99d1ca8ca0279a158f27ad62f5d0", "ja": "特別～？", "zh": "特别的～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5aa668c03f0c185537c0da283df0aa060e9e99d1ca8ca0279a158f27ad62f5d0", "ja": "特別～？", "zh": "特别的～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "3c8fa693a240e0a11eab150215d912e3aaa0a62efebd0c74336377e1aed6ff54", "ja": "だって、自転車でぶつかってきた女の子を\nスカウトするって。なんか、運命的っていうか……。", "zh": "因为签下骑脚踏车撞上自己的女孩子，\n感觉就像是命中注定一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "6a1fba84b170983a7dee28b50c9985006de4ac2f5beaef332c31c5fb58db7554", "ja": "言われてみれば……。\nちょっと、ドラマみたいだね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "这么一说的确……\n有点像是戏剧的情节呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "afdd9813ba0e08eadc3c168fbceced31ecb396bf724293cc7ab81930a7cd5e7d", "ja": "だから、{$P$}にとって、\n未来との出会いは運命で、特別なのかなって……。", "zh": "所以我才会觉得对{$P$}而言，\n遇见未来是命中注定，她是特别的存在嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "6e2b207321ad282d6c99d726f85140d7d2a28914f2f4838575d395297f8c4236", "ja": "運命で、特別……はっ！？", "zh": "命中注定，特别的存在……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "5a7aae713e48ffeec2b28273a3f0daeedde7dded8bc65f3de6fc937e69782283", "ja": "そ、それって{$P$}さんが、\n私を好きってこと～！！？", "zh": "那、那也就是说，{$P$}先生\n他喜欢我吗～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "8355c4a9d7e59a2b0fc4fe6cdbf0ccf464cb68560478691de7210d3cd5d216ec", "ja": "はぁ！？　ち、違うわよ、何言ってるの！　だって\n{$P$}が未来をなんて……あれ……？", "zh": "什么！？不、不是啦，你在说什么啊！\n{$P$}他怎么可能对未来……咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c4ffbe64390ba61790a2c4746a74e2286688b51f81d647a5ca87652e97bb843d", "ja": "えーっ！？　そんなのダメー！\n{$P$}さんは、わたしのだも～ん！", "zh": "咦──！？那可不行──！\n{$P$}先生是属于我的啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1030_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b4d8af9870dde96eb97714c4f6fbb6ca6d349501b3d72691c624439b2db74f6b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま……あれ？\nなんだ、まだ着替えてなかったのか。", "zh": "各位，辛苦了……咦？\n怎么了，你们还没换衣服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "55ed330c27f3d59de72aff0a4663be731c054cd1f2e5b400f6e8e1f99944ccbb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "91fb223dc7129ae0843ea01757127bbd90d82213bbb3f236f68ffb9c1101e2f2", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！\nわたしのこと、好きですよね？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！\n你喜欢我对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50a3008ff4d6b4c6c2b5c2adcd4bc9fefa913e65bc8d1d0d15271afa7cd7c6b4", "ja": "だから、次はわたしに新曲ください！\nお願いしま～す♪", "zh": "所以呀，下一首新歌请交给我吧！\n拜托了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "54b5df3b21f7f770655a6439c0cd276a473e4bd2d764e75573c186c34057b03c", "ja": "翼！？　抜け駆けするなんて、ずるいわよ！\n次は私ですよね、{$P$}！", "zh": "翼！？你竟然偷跑，太狡猾了！\n下一首是我的对吧？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "eebeee522265dba0bae94ac13604cb9a9c6b3664b68b8a615f89d0f36506d457", "ja": "そういうことなら、私たちも立候補しますよ！\nでも、とりあえずみんな、着替えるのが先かな？", "zh": "既然这样，那我们也要毛遂自荐喔！\n不过，总之先换衣服好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8a3eec3e47f44612a47ea469bf061128403c15900b8931b35305366aa5fe0a2b", "ja": "そ、そうそう。\n青羽さんに更衣室の鍵、閉められちゃうぞ？", "zh": "是、是啊。\n不然青羽小姐就要把更衣室锁起来啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "8db256affab43c1ac56822c300d0eb691f83728e1f6d86bd75bd1bc31bf400f7", "ja": "ああっ、そうでした！　みんな、早く着替えて打ち上げ\n行こう！　お願いもそこですればいいよ♪", "zh": "啊啊，我都忘了！大家，快换完衣服去开庆功宴吧！\n有什么请求也留到那边再说就行了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "d397c7a61c9b72d83e338186ac5143aa377479887744615af66a80fa868a6444", "ja": "そうね、じゃあ……\n{$P$}、絶対来てくださいね？", "zh": "说得也是，那么……\n{$P$}，你绝对要来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3cc2f0bd499fca0fa5a1bc82c58ba28cbb76f8e66efdc80a61c1e5c15213bdec", "ja": "あ、未来！　新曲チャレンジ、成功してよかったな。\n見ていて元気が出るライブだった。本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，未来！你这次挑战新歌成功真是太好了。\n这场演唱会光看就让人精神百倍，真的是辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "751e6ae52841481842e9f340255c132cc96ffb3183bdac112200adc761ac555d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへっ。\n元気出してもらえて、すっごく、よかったです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n能带给你活力，真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1042_p", "source_sha256": "cbf7846b99207c480684053f3e409be21361c33c6537fbf54408b1f5454c986b", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、未来にたくさん元気を\nもらえたと思う。よくやったな！", "zh": "我想在场的粉丝们，也从未来身上获得了许多活力。\n你做得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e7713e272f2d2b891e465489adabc19ea6fa47759688e67eb97b7c837b9c521", "ja": "{$P$}さん……はいっ！\nえへへ、ほめられちゃった……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嗯！\n嘿嘿，被夸奖了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1044_p", "source_sha256": "0ca07737e73393f91f2fee4a0f5290e834a665b06781341c7bf4b45353d8775a", "ja": "（少し照れくさそうに、未来は走り去っていった。\n……まっすぐなアイドルでも、壁にぶつかる事はある）", "zh": "（未来稍微有些害羞地跑走了。\n……即使是勇往直前的偶像，有时也会碰上瓶颈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_048_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_048_1045_p", "source_sha256": "06f06bd3ee64d833ad0fdc84d5323c421191e34ed5b30513243e650f4cfb536f", "ja": "（でも未来なら、乗り越えていけると信じてる。\n何と言っても、元気をくれるアイドルだからな！）", "zh": "（不过如果是未来，我相信她一定能跨越难关。\n毕竟她可是能带给人活力的偶像啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
